  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c620ed3ec65888f",
      "translationZh": "目前 Qwen 3.8 27b 使用的是以下 llama-server 设置，运行在单张 RTX 6000 Pro 上，这使得它能够以完整 bf16 精度运行，并使用 bf16 缓存支持 256kb 上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9be065fc2eb41259",
      "translationZh": "我不确定目前的设置是否最优，不过效果还不错。大家有没有采用不同的配置，取得更好的性能？（除了降低量化精度、缩短上下文、降低缓存量化精度之外）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0df9c12ac020e73f",
      "translationZh": "--no-mmap # 因为 ZFS 文件系统和 OOM 问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9efefe78a4b1bf6",
      "translationZh": "--spec-type draft-mtp # MTP 推测解码（解码速度约 2×）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f2e9d1041246b98",
      "translationZh": "--temp 0.1 # 因为主要用于代码分析",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b17a1381e0b8587",
      "translationZh": "另外，我也在考虑迁移到 vllm 或 sglang，我需要模型切换能力，以及尽可能好的性能。所以也欢迎大家在这方面给出建议（还有参数设置！）！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3fa2ae79676d140",
      "translationZh": "一些数据：生成速度为 50-60 t/s，处理长提示词（50kb）时，提示词处理速度最高可达 3000 t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
